{"data":{"body":"[P2] Enforce the byte budget for empty arrays\n\nEmpty arrays never enter the loop\u2019s `fitsCandidate` check, so repeated fields containing `[]` can make the preview exceed `maxPreviewBytes` without bound and potentially exhaust memory. Insert the completed array through `tryInsert` and add a small-budget regression with multiple empty arrays.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7omIqJ","finding_digest":"56681df6a6b220d51afba4cc4c480b45f7dce97f05281934f556b8293868ad49","finding_id":"arf_v1_kzub35vgwiqnkgx3utgeysalix","finding_key":"serdes-preview::collect-visible-array::empty-array-budget-enforcement","identity_key":"serdes-preview::collect-visible-array::empty-array-budget-enforcement","line":280,"observation_digest":"99bb71265141634e26a37bc5ffe52cf0583de4b8e98912affeb010916ce121a5","observation_id":"aro_v1_tg5xcjsrifru4jvdppc77zjm6b","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kzub35vgwiqnkgx3utgeysalix","published_at":"2026-09-01T08:37:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iby7s6ubl6mjzs7ua64efebk6b","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e8c9e1b514597f581acd43adf8039034437bb407","reviewer":"codex","start_line":280,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_4k5nxeds6um4dys4gc6rt4b3st"},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_kaacsuyfbul5hn7adzua4b2glh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T08:37:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
